<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Analyze your permit package — Palma Permit</title>
<meta name="description" content="Check your Florida building permit package against jurisdiction-specific requirements. Get a readiness score, missing-document list, and known gotchas in seconds.">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#0a0f1c">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/styles.css">
</head>
<body data-page="Analyze">
<div id="app-header"></div>

<main>
  <section class="section tight">
    <div class="wrap">
      <span class="eyebrow">Readiness analyzer</span>
      <h1 style="font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem)">Check your package.</h1>
      <p class="lead">Pick your city and permit type, confirm the documents you have, and get an instant readiness report with every city-specific gotcha. Free — no sign-up required to run your first checks.</p>

      <div class="analyzer" id="analyzer" style="margin-top:32px">
        <div class="card pad-lg">
          <div class="field">
            <label for="a-city">City <span class="hint">— loads that municipality's exact requirements</span></label>
            <select id="a-city"></select>
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="a-type">Permit type</label>
            <select id="a-type"></select>
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label>Your documents <span class="hint">— check what's in your package</span></label>
            <div class="checklist" id="a-checklist"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="card" style="background:rgba(76,201,176,.06);border-color:rgba(76,201,176,.25);margin-top:6px">
            <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start">
              <span class="icon-badge teal" style="flex:none">★</span>
              <div style="flex:1">
                <strong>Automated deep-read <span class="tag amber" style="margin-left:6px">Pro</span></strong>
                <p class="muted" style="margin:.3em 0 .7em;font-size:.92rem">Upload your actual PDFs — our automated document engine indexes each one, confirms the document type, and checks for signatures, seals, and valid product-approval numbers.</p>
                <label class="btn btn-ghost" style="cursor:pointer;font-size:.92rem;padding:9px 16px">
                  Choose files
                  <input id="a-files" type="file" accept="application/pdf,.pdf,.txt" multiple style="display:none">
                </label>
                <span id="a-files-list" class="muted" style="font-size:.85rem;margin-left:8px"></span>
                <div style="margin-top:12px">
                  <button id="a-ai-run" class="btn btn-primary" style="font-size:.94rem" disabled>Run automated deep-read</button>
                </div>
                <div id="a-ai-status" class="tip" style="margin-top:8px"></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div id="a-report" class="report"></div>
      </div>

      <p class="disclaimer">This readiness check reflects commonly required documents and documented rejection reasons for each city. It does not replace the municipality's official submittal checklist or a professional code review. Always confirm with the authority having jurisdiction before filing.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

<div id="app-footer"></div>
<script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/pdf.js/3.11.174/pdf.min.js"></script>
<script src="assets/data.js"></script>
<script src="assets/app.js"></script>
<script src="assets/auth.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
